    Develop to stage (#210)
    
    * dummy notification received, apollo websocket setup
    
    * only subscribe to notifications for logged in user
    
    * trigger modal on notification
    
    * display actual notification content in modal
    
    * add view badge button
    
    * add data to gql schema, extremely important confetti update
    
    * delete chat issue
    
    * Sucessfully open/close websocket based on login state
    
    * update _id for isAuth
    
    * working apollo version
    
    * add priority select to QuickAdd, keep media query for listview
    
    * default medium priority for Create Task modal
    
    * filter for Medium priority picks up null values
    
    * change dot color for null priority items to match medium
    
    * validate the date is valid before calling toISOString()
    
    * resiliency in onMouseLeave handlers on ListViewComponent
    
    * add fallback for id field when establishing isAuth
    
    * fix: slow loading issue fixed
    
    * fix: pagination on calendar and loading issue fixed
    
    * Added title extraction from response.data and moved the title update logic outside the new-conversation-only condition to allow for these slightly delayed smart-title updates. Chat titles now update on the frontend immediately when the microservice creates them
    
    * re-enable data fetching UI for spotify
    
    * update MetricsCard state to reflect unlink
    
    * add: privacy policy added to the code for google verification (#207)
    
    * Fix/task state (#209)
    
    * add: privacy policy added to the code for google verification
    
    * fix: state updated for task creation and reflected to main list, upcoming tasks opened indefault if no today's task
    
